{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>律政美劇《訴訟女王》（All's Fair）昨日（24日）於意大利羅馬音樂公園禮堂舉行第2季首映禮，有份參演的美國真人騷女星Kim Kardashian穿上豹紋露肩低胸連身長裙出席，期間又用圍巾包頭，成功搶鏡。同場還有Kim媽媽Kris Jenner，以及劇中拍檔英國女星娜奧美屈絲（Naomi Watts）、美國女星Sarah Paulson與美國女星Niecy Nash。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:50.009985+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:45:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.350995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:14.497049+00:00","content_hash":"91a8cfeea76006f0992044b109107702b93b82f3f6dae5b2411183f299432264","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:50.009985+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}